hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24185","Yazid informed us, Muhammad ibn Ishaq informed us, from his father, he said: Abu Dawud al-Mazini said; Yazid informed us, Muhammad ibn Ishaq informed us, from his father, he said: Muhammad said, my father narrated to me, from a man from Banu Mazin, from Abu Dawud al-Mazini, and he had witnessed Badr, he said, he said: I was following a man of the polytheists to strike him when his head fell before my sword reached him, so I knew someone other than me had killed him."
"24186","Yazid informed us, Muhammad ibn Ishaq informed us, from his father, he said: Abu Dawud al-Mazini said; Yazid informed us, Muhammad ibn Ishaq informed us, from his father, he said: Muhammad said, my father narrated to me, from a man from Banu Mazin, from Abu Dawud al-Mazini, and he had witnessed Badr, he said, he said: I was following a man of the polytheists to strike him when his head fell before my sword reached him, so I knew someone other than me had killed him."
